# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw and downloaded data. Nothing under data_raw/ belongs in version control:
# it is tens of gigabytes, it is public at the sources named in
# docs/DATA_SOURCES.md, and 00_setup/ fetches it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data_raw/
*.tsv.gz
*.vcf.gz
*.bgz
*.bed.gz
*.gaf.gz
*.tar

# MAGMA intermediates and logs. `*.log` is deliberately NOT ignored wholesale:
# results/magma_run.log is the progress file the README tells you to tail.
*.genes.raw
*.genes.annot
*.pval
data_raw/**/*.log
*.log.suppl
*.run.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Results and figures ARE tracked - they are the point of a companion
# repository - but their scratch files are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/*.tmp
results/*.part
figures/*.tmp

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
